msgid "⟦SEP_0005⟧ 7 ⟦SEP_0006⟧ Who demands the work? Haskell: laziness. ⟦SEP_0007⟧ [Ch 7](⟦DEST_0001⟧), **[demand guide](⟦DEST_0002⟧)**, [Haskell guide](⟦DEST_0003⟧) ⟦SEP_0008⟧ [B2](⟦DEST_0004⟧) ⟦SEP_0009⟧"
